WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:05.224
The next morning, Mole ran into the kitchen.

2
00:00:05.225 --> 00:00:08.523
Badger and Rat were making breakfast.

3
00:00:08.524 --> 00:00:12.052
Toad was swinging his sword around.

4
00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:15.737
"Where have you been?" asked Toad.

5
00:00:15.738 --> 00:00:20.068
"I was talking with the ferrets," grinned Mole.

6
00:00:20.069 --> 00:00:24.207
"I hope you were careful," said Rat, worried.

7
00:00:24.208 --> 00:00:28.750
"The ferrets had their guns, of course," said Mole.

8
00:00:28.751 --> 00:00:31.182
"But I was careful.

9
00:00:31.183 --> 00:00:34.572
I found Toad's old washwoman dress.

10
00:00:34.573 --> 00:00:37.310
So I put it on," said Mole.

11
00:00:37.311 --> 00:00:40.188
"You did?" asked Badger.

12
00:00:40.189 --> 00:00:45.256
"I put on the bonnet and shawl too!" laughed Mole.

13
00:00:45.257 --> 00:00:48.290
"Then I went to Toad Hall."

14
00:00:48.291 --> 00:00:52.560
"You were very brave, Mole," said Badger.

15
00:00:52.561 --> 00:00:56.549
Mole told them the story:

16
00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:59.637
"The ferrets act very important.

17
00:00:59.638 --> 00:01:02.692
'Who are you?' they shouted.

18
00:01:02.693 --> 00:01:06.572
'Good morning!' I said, very polite.

19
00:01:06.573 --> 00:01:09.999
'Do you need any washing done today?'

20
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.815
'Go away, washwoman!' they said.

21
00:01:13.816 --> 00:01:17.856
'We don't wash when we're on duty!'

22
00:01:17.857 --> 00:01:21.975
'Do you ever wash at all?' I said to them."

23
00:01:21.976 --> 00:01:27.330
Rat and Badger laughed.

24
00:01:27.331 --> 00:01:30.652
Mole smiled at his friends.

25
00:01:30.653 --> 00:01:34.451
"Wasn't that a great joke?" cried Mole.

26
00:01:34.452 --> 00:01:40.612
"Well, the joke was okay," said Toad.

27
00:01:40.613 --> 00:01:44.624
In fact, Toad was jealous.

28
00:01:44.625 --> 00:01:49.008
"It's not hard to do a trick like that," he thought.

29
00:01:49.009 --> 00:01:51.627
"I could do it easily.

30
00:01:51.628 --> 00:01:55.897
I slept late this morning, that's all."

